        point: "Appositives and Dashes for Definition",
        explanation: "同位語和破折號常用於在句子中直接插入定義或解釋，尤其在學術或科普寫作中。",
        examples: [
          { en: "A protein called Cas9 — which acts like molecular scissors — cuts DNA precisely.", zh: "一種稱為Cas9的蛋白質——它就像分子剪刀一樣——精確地切割DNA。" },
          { en: "\"Off-target\" effects — edits in the wrong location — could cause new diseases.", zh: "「脫靶」效應——即在錯誤位置的編輯——可能導致新疾病。" }
        ]
